@startuml
!include _yunlink_protocol_theme.iuml
title Sunray ROS1 Bridge - Current System Context

actor "Ground Client / Monitor" as Ground

rectangle "YunLink Network" <<Control>> {
  component "Runtime\nSession / Authority / Auto Result" as Network <<Control>>
}

rectangle "Air Side" <<Neutral>> {
  component "yunlink_ros_bridge" as Bridge <<Control>>

  package "Sunray ROS Graph" <<Neutral>> {
    component "local_odom / odom_state" as Odom <<StatePlane>>
    component "px4_state" as Px4State <<StatePlane>>
    component "control_cmd / control_state" as Control <<Control>>
    component "command_execution_status" as Execution <<StatePlane>>
    component "sunray_system services" as Services <<Neutral>>
  }
}

Ground <--> Network : YunLink TCP / UDP
Network <--> Bridge : command / snapshot / service envelopes
Odom --> Bridge : subscribe
Px4State --> Bridge : subscribe
Control <--> Bridge : subscribe / publish
Execution --> Bridge : subscribe
Bridge <--> Services : service client

note bottom
Runtime auto-result 表示协议命令已通过 gate，
不表示 Sunray 或 PX4 已完成飞行动作。
end note
@enduml
